                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Windows/releases/tag/v8.3.260402-preview2"&gt;[Pre-release] v8.3.260402-preview2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;First official build with WindowsAppSDK 1.8 support for the new package structure. The WCT now only depends on &lt;a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.WindowsAppSDK.WinUI/" rel="nofollow"&gt;&lt;code&gt;Microsoft.WindowsAppSDK.WinUI&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for WinUI 3 projects instead of the full WindowsAppSDK. This required updates in our dependencies of both the XAML Behaviors and Win2D, this latest package references their latest releases as well. Projects using WCT and Windows App SDK, will also need to migrate to WinAppSDK 1.8, otherwise, please continue to use the 8.2 release.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please let us know if you encounter any issues with these updates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update Microsoft.WindowsAppSDK to 1.8 stable&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Arlodotexe/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Arlodotexe"&gt;@Arlodotexe&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4174420183" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Windows/issues/837" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Windows/pull/837/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Windows/pull/837"&gt;#837&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Narrow AdvancedCollectionView trimming warning so that it only triggers in unsafe usages, add SortDescription to preserve metadata by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/sylveon/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/sylveon"&gt;@sylveon&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3364828016" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Windows/issues/724" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Windows/pull/724/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Windows/pull/724"&gt;#724&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;New Contributors&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/sylveon/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/sylveon"&gt;@sylveon&lt;/a&gt; made their first contribution in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3364828016" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Windows/issues/724" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Windows/pull/724/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Windows/pull/724"&gt;#724&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
